### Member: Available Classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/classes
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

### Member: Hold Single Session Booking and Get Summary
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/classes/{{fitnessClassId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Rahman Hossain",
  "email": "rahman@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+8801711111111",
  "location": "Gulshan, Dhaka",
  "selectedClassType": "IN_PERSON",
  "comment": "I prefer morning sessions.",
  "availabilitySlotId": "{{availabilitySlotId}}",
  "couponCode": "PLACEHOLDER"
}

### Member: Hold Monthly Session Booking and Get Summary
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/classes/{{monthlyFitnessClassId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Rahman Hossain",
  "email": "rahman@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+8801711111111",
  "location": "Gulshan, Dhaka",
  "selectedClassType": "ONLINE",
  "comment": "Monthly plan selected from trainer calendar.",
  "availabilitySlotIds": [
    "{{availabilitySlotId1}}",
    "{{availabilitySlotId2}}",
    "{{availabilitySlotId3}}"
  ],
  "couponCode": "PLACEHOLDER"
}

### Member: Create Stripe PaymentIntent for Flutter SDK
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/booking-payments/{{bookingPaymentId}}/stripe-payment-intent
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

### Member: Confirm Booking Payment After Stripe Success
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/booking-payments/{{bookingPaymentId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

{
  "provider": "stripe",
  "paymentMethod": "card",
  "providerSessionId": "{{paymentIntentId}}"
}

### Member: Mark Booking Payment Failed
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/booking-payments/{{bookingPaymentId}}/fail
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

{
  "provider": "stripe",
  "paymentMethod": "card",
  "providerSessionId": "{{paymentIntentId}}"
}

### Member: My Booked Classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

### Member: Next Booked Class
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/bookings/next
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

### Member: Homepage Next Workouts
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/workouts/next?limit=5
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}
